  "text": "a configurable cap on headless Claude sessions/builds running at once (default 6), a heavy test/build lock (default 3), a memory guard (default 2 GB); extras wait in a FIFO+priority queue and start when a slot frees; finished sessions don't count and close by themselves. Console: slots in the activity banner summary, queue on the Builds page (move up / cancel), settings in Settings and the Breakroom; swarm respects the cap; systems-check memory/swap item.",
